    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried that. i went into my room and turned the lights off and everything. but it doesn't work. the noise is still in my head, it's like it's part of me now. there's no \"small pocket\" of quiet that actually works. it's just constant. i just want the noise to stop for good. i want it to be permanent.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
