      "content": "It sounds like the internal noise is truly relentless, and that feeling of constant pressure is exhausting. When the internal noise feels inseparable from you, it can feel hopeless, but please know that relief is possible. If the internal storm feels too big to manage alone, reaching out to a professional who specializes in mental health can provide targeted tools to help quiet that internal chatter. You don't have to navigate this overwhelming feeling by yourself.",
      "source": "target",
