      "content": "i don't want more tools or \"coping mechanisms.\" i've tried everything. it's not about managing the noise anymore, it's about the fact that the noise is just... life. life is loud. i just want to be somewhere where nothing can reach me. where there's just nothing. that's the only kind of silence that would actually work for me.",
